1. copy original file and make a new file 

2. open the new file and find out the location of the last signal pin

3. Erase from the start row of Power pin to the end of the file

4. save and quit 

5. just execute ./make_tdf.sh 
	EX) ./make_tdf.sh [memory.vclef] [x_size] [y_size]
     
REF) You can check x_size and y_size in the begining of vclef file
     Find "SIZE" word with using "/" character 

